### 1. Add resident
POST http://localhost:8080/api/residents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ajay",
  "roomNumber": "A101"
}

###

### 2. View all residents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/residents

###

### 3. Create weekly menu
POST http://localhost:8080/api/menu/week?weekStartDate=2026-09-28

###

### 4. Add breakfast meal
POST http://localhost:8080/api/menu/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weekStartDate": "2026-09-28",
  "mealDate": "2026-09-29",
  "mealType": "BREAKFAST",
  "foodName": "Idli and Sambar"
}

###

### 5. Add lunch meal
POST http://localhost:8080/api/menu/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weekStartDate": "2026-09-28",
  "mealDate": "2026-09-29",
  "mealType": "LUNCH",
  "foodName": "Sambar Rice"
}

###

### 6. View meals for one date
GET http://localhost:8080/api/menu/meals/date/2026-09-29

###

### 7. Submit feedback
POST http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": 1,
  "mealId": 1,
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Food was good"
}

###

### 8. Get meal average rating
GET http://localhost:8080/api/feedback/meal/1/average

###

### 9. Resident opt-out for one date
POST http://localhost:8080/api/residents/opt-out
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": 1,
  "optOutDate": "2026-09-30"
}

###

### 10. Get daily headcount
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/headcount?date=2026-09-30

###

### 11. Get low-rated meals for week
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/low-rated?weekStartDate=2026-09-28